<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>消痕侠—数字痕迹管理平台</title>
<meta name="description" content="数字痕迹来源检索、证据核验、申请记录与人工跟进；数据覆盖有限">
<link rel="icon" href="${docroot}/static/img/xhen-brand.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link href="${docroot}/static/node_modules/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="${docroot}/static/node_modules/alertifyjs/build/css/alertify.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="${docroot}/static/node_modules/tablesorter/dist/css/theme.default.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="${docroot}/static/node_modules/tablesorter/dist/css/jquery.tablesorter.pager.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="${docroot}/static/css/privacyguard.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="${docroot}/static/css/fluent.css?v=competition-1" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="${docroot}/static/node_modules/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
<script src="${docroot}/static/js/fluent-ui.js?v=competition-1" defer></script>
</head>
<%def name="nav_icon(kind)">
<svg class="fl-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
% if kind == 'overview':
<rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
% elif kind == 'search':
<circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7"/><path d="m15 15 6 6M10 7v6M7 10h6"/>
% elif kind == 'progress':
<path d="M4 5h16M4 12h16M4 19h16"/><circle cx="8" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="2"/>
% else:
<path d="M5 3h11l4 4v14H5zM15 3v5h5M8 12h8M8 16h6"/>
% endif
</svg>
</%def>
<body class="pg-body fluent-body" data-page="${pageid | h}">
<a class="fl-skip" href="#mainbody">跳转到主要内容</a>
<header class="fl-topbar">
<a class="fl-brand" href="${docroot}/#overview"><span class="fl-brand-icon"><img src="${docroot}/static/img/xhen-brand.svg" alt=""></span><span><strong>消痕侠</strong><small>数字痕迹管理平台</small></span></a>
<span class="fl-top-caption">数字痕迹管理平台</span>
<div class="fl-top-actions"><span class="fl-coverage">来源透明 · 数据覆盖有限</span><span class="fl-avatar" title="当前登录用户" aria-label="当前登录用户">我</span><a class="fl-logout" href="${docroot}/logout">退出登录</a><button class="fl-menu" id="fl-menu" type="button" aria-label="展开导航" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sidebar"><svg class="fl-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg></button></div>
</header>
<aside class="pg-sidebar fl-sidebar" id="sidebar">
<p class="fl-nav-label">我的工作区</p>
<nav class="fl-navigation" aria-label="主导航">
<a class="fl-nav ${'active' if pageid == 'SCANLIST' else ''}" href="${docroot}/#overview">${nav_icon('overview')}<span>总览仪表盘</span></a>
<a class="fl-nav" data-live-view="new" href="${docroot}/livesearch#new">${nav_icon('search')}<span>新建检索</span></a>
<a class="fl-nav" data-live-view="progress" href="${docroot}/livesearch#progress">${nav_icon('progress')}<span>检索进度</span></a>
<a class="fl-nav" data-live-view="results" href="${docroot}/livesearch#results">${nav_icon('results')}<span>统一结果中心</span></a>
<a class="fl-nav ${'active' if pageid == 'PRIVACYACTION' else ''}" href="${docroot}/privacyaction">${nav_icon('requests')}<span>申请记录与人工跟进</span></a>
</nav>
<details class="fl-other-nav"><summary>SpiderFoot 与其他功能</summary><nav aria-label="其他功能">
<a href="${docroot}/#scans">原生扫描任务</a><a href="${docroot}/newscan">原生新建扫描</a><a href="${docroot}/leakcheck">本地样例泄露检测</a><a href="${docroot}/riskalertspage">风险告警</a><a href="${docroot}/dataviz">数据洞察看板</a><a href="${docroot}/servicemonitor">服务监控</a><a href="${docroot}/opts">系统设置</a>
</nav></details>
<div class="fl-sidebar-foot"><p>数据覆盖有限<br>匹配线索需要人工核验</p><span>v${version}</span></div>
</aside>
<main class="pg-main fl-main" id="mainbody"><div class="pg-content fl-content">
